        <p>This eminent and world famed Pianist uses a CHAPPELL GRAND PIANOFORTE Itt all his recitals. This fact In itself planes Chappell* in the forefront of pianoforte manufacturers and their pianos %re the chosen instruments of the most renowned judges tti themusical worIA. The one and ONLY place In Warrington littld district where Chappell Pianos can be obt aimed is</p>
